        "detailed_description": "<h1>YOLO SPACE HACKER 2  FINALLY AVAILABLE ON STEAM!! !!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[url][/url]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it to the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discovering the basic tools of a pentester in YSH 1, then analyzing files and network traces in Forensic, it's time to tackle the web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yolo Space Hacker 2 opens up a whole new playground: an entire planet to pwn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the agenda:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully 3D universe, more immersive than ever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltration, exploration... and even parachute jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper rifles, drones, flags galore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more tools to test, understand, and exploit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweepo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reserved for the most determined:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >→ a map, chests, clues to locate and unlock an Overbike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to your feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Hack the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>You're now a full-fledged member of the Yolo Space Hacker team.<br><br>This is your chance to get to grips with the new equipment:<br>- electric snipes<br>- cyber binoculars<br>- parachute<br>- drone<br><br>In 3D TPS, alternate between infiltration and hacking into cameras and servers, using real tools and real security holes.<br><br>Chain missions together: <br>- disabling a satellite jamming site<br>- infiltration of a military camp<br>- Bahamas Bank penetration test<br><br>You'll need to hone your OSInt skills, prepare a trojan, and carry out targeted phishing to penetrate the bank, and open the vaults discreetly...<br><br>And if you don't have enough, or if it's all too easy, switch at will between beginner and expert modes.<br>And find the bonus servers - they're everywhere.<br><br>Good Hacks",
        "about_the_game": "You're now a full-fledged member of the Yolo Space Hacker team.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is your chance to get to grips with the new equipment:<br />\r\n- electric snipes<br />\r\n- cyber binoculars<br />\r\n- parachute<br />\r\n- drone<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn 3D TPS, alternate between infiltration and hacking into cameras and servers, using real tools and real security holes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChain missions together: <br />\r\n- disabling a satellite jamming site<br />\r\n- infiltration of a military camp<br />\r\n- Bahamas Bank penetration test<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou'll need to hone your OSInt skills, prepare a trojan, and carry out targeted phishing to penetrate the bank, and open the vaults discreetly...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd if you don't have enough, or if it's all too easy, switch at will between beginner and expert modes.<br />\r\nAnd find the bonus servers - they're everywhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood Hacks",
        "short_description": "Alternate between infiltration and hacking of cameras and servers, using real tools. Sharpen your OSInt skills, prepare a trojan, and launch a targeted phishing attack to hack in total discretion...",
